\f1\insrsid9855256\charrsid9855256 
Globalization is a term that is used to describe the changing world order in which various aspects of a nation that include the economic, social, political, cultural and environmental factors are viewed as being part of a global community and not rest}{
\rtlch\fcs1 \af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\insrsid9855256 ricted in their scope. But according to an organization }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f1\insrsid9855256\charrsid9855256 Globalization}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\insrsid9855256 
 means that for a company to survive it must establish markets not only in its own country but also in many other countries of the world.
\par }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f1\insrsid9855256\charrsid9855256      Implications of globalization}{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f1\insrsid9855256 : There are }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af1 \ltrch\fcs0 \f1\insrsid9855256 various 
